{"final":{"answer":"The reserve for product warranties increased by $6 million from 2005 to 2006 (from $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005 to $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006).","value":6,"unit":"million USD","sources":["source:q11n3","source:q11n4"],"result_id":"tool:1","explanation":"Reserve for product warranties at Dec. 31, 2006 = $10 million (source:q11n3); at Dec. 31, 2005 = $4 million (source:q11n4). Change = 10 - 4 = 6 million (an increase)."}}